<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Thursday 102,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Thursday 102,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual interior Iowa and southern Minnesota hog receipts Thursday were 102,000 head, compared with the estimate of 105,000, USDA said.</p>
<p>Opening trade not well established.  Early sales Barrows and Gilts were steady to firm compared to midsession Thursday.</p>
<p>				  Country		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    57.00 -58.50	   58.00 -59.50</p>
<p>Liberal volume	 58.00 -58.50	   59.00 -59.50</p>
<p>Sows:  steady to 2.00 lower.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  44.00 -45.00	   45.00 -47.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   44.00 -46.00	   45.00 -47.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    46.00 -50.00	   46.00 -51.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
